  XL 30 is *not* bad.  It's usually unnecessary, though.  It's
also a special case as once you hit XL 30, you can keep getting
hp and mana increases without raising your XL.

  XL 30 is perfect for wizards, and not necessarily bad for
anyone else.  Since magic missile does damage per hit based
on XL, higher XL can make it into a devastating weapon.

  At XL 30 magic missile does over 56 points of damage per
hit.  With the possibility of multiple hits per turn, on single/ 
multiple monster(s), at range.  

  And that's for any character at any level of attack spell 
skill.  Easily better than even Mjollnir at range as it never
hurts monsters/your equipment.  Can't be lost in lava/water, 
either.

  As a knight with the Magic Mirror of Merlin, you could have
been doing twice that, easily 112 points of damage per hit.


